@@ -1,9 +1,17 @@
 # CONTRACT — geometric_control (mini continuation of sontag_book)

 ## Ownership
-- Worker edits only its task's `files`; never `DynamicalSystems.lean` (coordinator wires imports).
+- Worker edits only its task's `files` and explicit `support_files`.
+  Root imports stay coordinator-owned unless the task explicitly owns
+  `DynamicalSystems.lean` and requests integration.
 - One writer per file; agy/pi-muse-authored tasks dispatched by coordinator only.
 - Corrections = new `*-trim` tasks; accepted tasks never reopened.
+- `files` are required Lean sources. `support_files` are exact owned paths for docs
+  or an import-only root; they participate in acceptance hashes but are not scanned
+  as proof sources. List the root in `modules` to build its imports.
+- `lean_checks` lists owned Lean consumer probes that must exist and compile after
+  the module build. Use them to check exact theorem types; `required` names alone
+  only check availability. These probes also receive the proof-token scan.

 ## Statement fidelity
 - Sources: Krener encyclopedia chapter (printed pp. ~563–570) + Sontag Ch. 4 §4.1–4.5.
