-# TASK — simultaneous rectification of commuting vector fields (the Krener lemma)
-
-You are working in a Lean 4 + Mathlib repo (`auto_automatyk` workspace, library at
-`DynamicalSystems/DynamicalSystems/`). **Work on the branch `geometric-ralph`** (already pushed to
